tput": "Evaluation: Playing J3 (White Dragon) is the safest move as it is a single tile not part of any potential meld and has multiple unshown tiles left, minimizing the risk of others needing it.\nReason: J3 is a single tile with no potential for forming a pung or kong, and since there are three unshown J3 tiles remaining, discarding it reduces the chance of others completing their hands. This allows preserving more versatile tiles for future melds or scoring patterns.\nAnswer: Play J3"}
